ol about what  you guys think is the single biggest  issue not just from your school but  across education as a whole as a concept  in this country so please get commenting  get video-making get messaging whatever  and I'm really interested to hear what  you guys have to say also as a quick  update in about weeks time I'm going to  be starting a short series on exam  preparation and exam technique I realize  that we're going into the exam season at  the moment and hopefully a lot of you  are very deep into your revision  strategies already but this will be  hopefully a bit of motivation and it'll  be  to sharpen your skills and that's just  give me a few videos in that series  coming up on this channel slightly  starting from about next week and them  from there we'll see how quickly I can  do them if you'd like to stay updated  about that by the way you can follow me  at Simon Oxford's on Twitter and I now  have a Facebook page facebook.com  forward slash You Tube Simon because I'm  really imaginative and I'll be posting  updates about what's going on and also I  realized that YouTube subscription box  is kind of a little bit broken so I'll  be putting my videos on both of those  platforms as well right thanks for  watching and get commenting
 

